 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 02\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o UTAX AXtrail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se de <strong>16 a 18 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, tendo como centro operacional e zona de partidas\/chegadas a <strong>Praia das Rocas em Castanheira de Pera<\/strong>, distrito de Leiria.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O UTAX AXtrail integra cinco dist\u00e2ncias: <strong>UTAX 107 km<\/strong>, <strong>TSL 56 km<\/strong>, <strong>TX 32 km<\/strong>, <strong>MTX 16 km<\/strong> e o <strong>Caminho do Xisto (Caminhada)<\/strong>, al\u00e9m de provas infantis no AXtrail Kids.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">At\u00e9 quando decorrem as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a <strong>2 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> \u00e0s 23h59 atrav\u00e9s do portal oficial no Stop and Go, mediante disponibilidade de vagas em cada dist\u00e2ncia.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a exig\u00eancia t\u00e9cnica e o desn\u00edvel dos percursos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os percursos percorrem trilhos de montanha t\u00e9cnicos na <strong>Serra da Lous\u00e3<\/strong>, caracterizados por declives acentuados, single tracks e passagens em cal\u00e7ada de xisto, exigindo equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio adequado e boa prepara\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no UTAX AXtrail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais est\u00e3o abertas na plataforma <a href=\"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/utax-axtrail2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stop and Go<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"AXTrail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-18\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Praia das Rocas, Castanheira de Pera\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Castanheira de Pera\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"AXtrail Series e Munic\u00edpio de Castanheira de Pera\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o UTAX AXtrail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se de 16 a 18 de Outubro de 2026 , tendo como centro operacional e zona de partidas\/chegadas a Praia das Rocas em Castanheira de Pera , distrito de Leiria.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O UTAX AXtrail integra cinco dist\u00e2ncias: UTAX 107 km , TSL 56 km , TX 32 km , MTX 16 km e o Caminho do Xisto (Caminhada) , al\u00e9m de provas infantis no AXtrail Kids.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"At\u00e9 quando decorrem as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": 